BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-0-20261204T2200@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T233000
SUMMARY:Welcome dinner at Mangrove
DESCRIPTION:A relaxed first night. Jamaican food and cocktails downtown at 103 NW 1st Ave. The kitchen is open until 11:45 on Fridays and there’s a DJ later. Around $30 each before drinks. Book.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-1-20261205T1000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
SUMMARY:Breakfast at Libertino Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Wynwood\, 2659 NW 2nd Ave. Good coffee\, milk bread sandwiches and waffles.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-2-20261205T1130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T133000
SUMMARY:Galleries
DESCRIPTION:We’ll walk through Wynwood and the Design District. ICA Miami is free\, and Superblue is $42 if you want to add it. Book a time.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-3-20261205T1330@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T140000
SUMMARY:Water taxi to the fair
DESCRIPTION:Free. Boats leave the Venetian Marina\, 1635 N Bayshore Dr\, every 7–9 minutes for Maurice Gibb Park in Miami Beach. A free shuttle goes from there to the fair.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-4-20261205T1400@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T183000
SUMMARY:Art Basel Miami Beach
DESCRIPTION:Miami Beach Convention Center\, open until 6. The $92 day ticket is all we need.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-5-20261205T1830@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T200000
SUMMARY:Home to get ready
DESCRIPTION:Water taxi back\, or a shared ride.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-6-20261205T2000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T220000
SUMMARY:Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Still deciding between somewhere special and somewhere more affordable. I’ll confirm closer to the date.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-7-20261205T2200@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261205T233000
SUMMARY:Everyday People
DESCRIPTION:The Art Week party. The 2026 date isn’t out yet. Last year it was on Saturday and cost $35.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-8-20261206T1000@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T113000
SUMMARY:VOUS Church
DESCRIPTION:Design District\, 77 NE 40th St. Services at 10 and 12.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-9-20261206T1130@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T121500
SUMMARY:Matcha at Bigface
DESCRIPTION:40 NE 40th St\, across the street.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-10-20261206T1215@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T121500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T134500
SUMMARY:Magic City Flea Market
DESCRIPTION:At Ironside in Little River\, 7580 NE 4th Ct\, a few minutes from the house. Vintage clothes\, handmade pieces and art from local vendors. It usually opens at noon on Sundays. I’ll confirm the hours for that weekend.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-11-20261206T1345@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T134500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T150000
SUMMARY:Wynwood Walls
DESCRIPTION:About $12–15\, and an hour is plenty.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-12-20261206T1500@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T163000
SUMMARY:Casa Neos
DESCRIPTION:A day party on the Miami River. About $100–150 each. If you’re flying home Sunday\, pack in the morning and head to the airport from here. Book.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-13-20261207T0900@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T110000
SUMMARY:Coffee\, then pack
DESCRIPTION:Checkout is at 11\, which I’m confirming with the host. We’ll bring our bags with us.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oe-14-20261207T1100@openedition
DTSTAMP:20261108T140433Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T123000
SUMMARY:Work from Miami
DESCRIPTION:A coworking space in Wynwood or a café with good Wi-Fi. We’ll pick one closer to the date.
END:VEVENT
