DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T180000
SUMMARY:Beach club\, maybe
DESCRIPTION:Nikki Beach or Joia Beach\, about $100–150 each. We’ll only go if enough people are interested\, so let me know in the RSVP.
END:VEVENT
